ReUI — Timeline

Retrieved 2026-09-08 with the installed shadcn 4.19.1 CLI: `shadcn view @reui/timeline` (Radix variant in the original review-timeline worktree).

- Registry item: https://reui.io/docs/components/radix/timeline
- Canonical repository: https://github.com/keenthemes/reui
- License: https://github.com/keenthemes/reui/blob/main/LICENSE.md (MIT; reproduced in licenses/reui.txt)
- Original source SHA-256: `a4c56c23dd98f5f4b669e49d69bfdda98fcf15c28fa4a38f4dd1841b9d1d65f0`

Local changes: attribution header and repository formatting. The application passes value zero for source declarations, so their order never implies execution or completion. No ReUI Pro blocks, remote assets, or additional npm dependencies are included. During the user-requested timeline merge, the unused Slot-based wrappers were removed so the display primitives use only React and cn. Scenario controls use the application’s shadcn Base UI components. Redpact maintainers own this copied source and should compare upstream changes through the shadcn CLI.

